==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Bears Be Back]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Kill the first Gabriel with [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]], [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cutter Cat]], or some other high-DPS/[[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rusher]] unit, then use [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]] or some other long-ranged unit to defeat the Audience Bears and Variety Bears. Use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] or the previously mentioned high-DPS/rusher units to easily take care of the Angelic Gory. Keep repeating this process until you win.

